  <name>MangoMod</name>
  <summary>GUI configuration manager for MangoWM</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      MangoMod is a GTK4/libadwaita application for editing MangoWM
      compositor configuration files.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Reads and writes MangoWM's flat key=value config format</li>
      <li>Follows every source= and source-optional= include</li>
      <li>Preserves comments and blank lines across saves</li>
      <li>Interactive monitor canvas with drag-and-drop positioning</li>
      <li>Keybinding editor with MangoWM action catalog</li>
      <li>Window rules and layer rules editor</li>
      <li>Raw config editor with validation</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

